Adapted for the unmodified PHP 7.2.34 release source.
Both concatenation branches receive the vendor overflow guards.
Required string-size limit definitions are taken from Canonical's
CVE-2017-9118 prerequisite patches in the same source package.
Regenerate Zend/zend_vm_execute.h with Zend/zend_vm_gen.php after applying.
Original vendor patch and attribution follow.

Backport of:

From 712e60f9edfd03f0960fc4fc3c2c375f42b90aa2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Arnaud Le Blanc <arnaud.lb@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 20:09:54 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid state corruption via bailout

Minimal mitigation for EOL version.

Fix GHSA-w8hw-w9fx-j79w (CVE-2026-109618)
Fix GHSA-6wmf-4rv5-p3rp (CVE-2026-109619)

Co-authored-by: Ilija Tovilo <ilija.tovilo@me.com>

